# checkpoints as ((x, y, z), angle), together the value of SRace.race (a tuple). "run point" evaluates the text the
# way the script reads its literal (ints stay ints). A map without a section keeps the race it had. A pack in mods/
# with scrapc/split/srace.def replaces this file.

